ontent"></a></p>
<p data-sourcepos=3D"46:1-46:79" dir=3D"auto">Modernize your data infrastru=
cture with fully managed, purpose-built databases.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto" data-sourcepos=3D"48:2-48:382">AWS offers 15+ purpose-built=
 engines to support diverse data models, including relational, key-value, d=
ocument, in-memory, graph, time series, wide column, and ledger databases. =
Start small and scale as your applications grow with relational databases t=
hat are 3-5X faster than popular alternatives, or non-relational databases =
that give you microsecond to sub-millisecond latency.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto" data-sourcepos=3D"50:2-50:257">Free your teams from time-co=
nsuming database tasks like server provisioning, patching, and backups. AWS=
 fully managed database services provide continuous monitoring, self-healin=
g storage, and automated scaling to help you focus on application developme=
nt.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto" data-sourcepos=3D"52:2-52:295">Support multi-region, multi-=
primary replication, and provide full data oversight with multiple levels o=
f security, including network isolation and end-to-end encryption. AWS data=
bases deliver the high availability, reliability, and security you need for=
 business-critical, enterprise workloads.</p>
