3:132">in-memory cache</strong> environments in the AWS Cloud. It provides =
a high performance, resizable, and cost-effective in-memory cache, while re=
moving complexity associated with deploying and managing a distributed cach=
e environment. ElastiCache works with both the Redis and Memcached engines.=
</p>
<p dir=3D"auto" data-sourcepos=3D"185:1-185:37">Supports Memcached and Redi=
